% Binding Tariff Information of EU customs offices (EBTI,
% https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/ebti/) run through the SAME
% apparel model (apparel.le, with gri.le) as the US rulings.
%
% One scenario per ruling; each style is described by the facts the ruling
% states, each fact citing the ruling ("as stated in BTI DEBTI22950/25-1"); the
% office's judgments carry who made them and why. The ruling's own code is NOT
% a fact: the expectation is the six-digit subheading the model derives, and
% where it differs from the ruling's the comment says so (DISAGREES) and why.
% Selection: the most recent valid BTI (English, French or German) for each
% of the same subheadings (September 2026). A BTI gives an eight-digit CN code
% whose first six digits are the HS subheading compared here. See
% README.md for the method and the results.

the target language is: prolog.
scenario facts require provenance.

the knowledge base apparel ebti includes these resources:
    apparel.

the knowledge base apparel ebti includes:

query subheading is:
    the subheading of which good is which code.

query heading is:
    the heading of which good is which heading.

query unplaced is:
    which good is not placed by the model.

% BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256, French customs, 22/07/2026: men's high-visibility polo.
scenario bti_frbtifr_bti_2026_04256 is:
    the high visibility polo is an upper body garment, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256.
    the high visibility polo is classified under the EU tariff, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256.
    the fabric construction of the high visibility polo is knitted, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256.
    the cut of the high visibility polo indicates men, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256.
    the high visibility polo has a collar, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256.
    the high visibility polo has an opening starting at the neckline, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256.
    the high visibility polo closes left over right, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256.
    the high visibility polo contains 55 percent of cotton, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256.
    the high visibility polo contains 45 percent of polyester, as stated in BTI FRBTIFR-BTI-2026-04256.
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the high visibility polo is 6105.10"].

