% BTI DEBTI17890/26-1, Hauptzollamt Hannover, 14/07/2026: shirt of a two-piece shirt and trousers set.
scenario bti_debti17890_26_1 is:
    the embroidered cotton shirt is an upper body garment, as stated in BTI DEBTI17890/26-1.
    the embroidered cotton shirt is classified under the EU tariff, as stated in BTI DEBTI17890/26-1.
    the fabric construction of the embroidered cotton shirt is woven, as stated in BTI DEBTI17890/26-1.
    the embroidered cotton shirt closes left over right, as stated in BTI DEBTI17890/26-1.
    the embroidered cotton shirt has a collar, as stated in BTI DEBTI17890/26-1.
    the embroidered cotton shirt has an opening starting at the neckline, as stated in BTI DEBTI17890/26-1.
    the embroidered cotton shirt contains 100 percent of cotton, as stated in BTI DEBTI17890/26-1.
    the embroidered cotton shirt is claimed to belong to sleepwear, as stated in BTI DEBTI17890/26-1.
    the claim that the embroidered cotton shirt belongs to sleepwear is rejected,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, as stated in BTI DEBTI17890/26-1,
        because "by cut, material and overall impression the garments can be worn in bed or elsewhere alike, so they are not intended to be worn exclusively or essentially as nightwear".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the embroidered cotton shirt is 6205.20"].

% BTI DEBTI9846/26-1, Hauptzollamt Hannover, 05/06/2026: women's woven blouse.
scenario bti_debti9846_26_1 is:
% DISAGREES: Hauptzollamt Hannover gives 6206.30; the model gives no heading — the office finds the garment 'presents itself as a blouse' (the CN Explanatory Note: light, fancy, mostly loose-fitting) but records no loose fit, and sleeveless it is no shirt.
    the sleeveless flounced blouse is an upper body garment, as stated in BTI DEBTI9846/26-1.
    the sleeveless flounced blouse is classified under the EU tariff, as stated in BTI DEBTI9846/26-1.
    the fabric construction of the sleeveless flounced blouse is woven, as stated in BTI DEBTI9846/26-1.
    the cut of the sleeveless flounced blouse indicates women, as stated in BTI DEBTI9846/26-1.
    the sleeveless flounced blouse is sleeveless, as stated in BTI DEBTI9846/26-1.
    the sleeveless flounced blouse has an opening starting at the neckline, as stated in BTI DEBTI9846/26-1.
    the fabric of the sleeveless flounced blouse is lightweight, as stated in BTI DEBTI9846/26-1.
    the textile material of the sleeveless flounced blouse is cotton,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, as stated in BTI DEBTI9846/26-1,
        because "the yarns are of cotton, which predominates, and of textile yarn combined with metal (metalized yarn of heading 5605); the BTI gives no percentages".
    subheading expects answers [].
    unplaced expects answers ["the sleeveless flounced blouse is not placed by the model"].

